202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Many industry giants are already leading the charge. Meta, for example, runs on 100% renewable energy, setting a benchmark for others. Amazon's data center operations currently use 90% renewable energy, with plans to hit 100% by the end of 2025. While these efforts are beneficial for the environment, they introduce new challenges for traditional power grids.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
